NOTICE for latent-sparse-attention-rocm
======================================

This project is an independent, non-official ROCm validation and port harness for
Latent Sparse Attention (LSA).

Upstream provenance
-------------------
The LSA algorithm, the pure-PyTorch reference implementations ("the oracle"), and
the Triton kernels composed by this project are from:

    Prefrontal-AI/latent-sparse-attention
    https://github.com/Prefrontal-AI/latent-sparse-attention
    pinned commit: see third_party/upstream.sha (validated: 5ebea732d639576d2a7579b0de40e6252f9001f5)

    Copyright (c) Prefrontal AI, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The upstream checkout lives in third_party/latent-sparse-attention (git-ignored,
fetched by scripts/checkout_upstream.sh) and is NEVER modified or redistributed in
source form by this repository. Its CUDA/CuTe-DSL kernel paths are NVIDIA-only and
are not used here; this project composes the upstream *Triton* kernels on ROCm and
validates them against the upstream PyTorch oracle.

